      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For a gritty, street-level crime drama, the characters that naturally fit in are Jax, Andre, and potentially Marcus, who could reveal a darker side to his character beneath the polished exterior. Jax's street smarts and nosiness could make him an excellent detective, while Andre's street knowledge could help him navigate the underworld. \n\nFor a polished, high-society drama, the characters that evoke this vibe are Elena, Kenji, and to a lesser extent, Marcus, who could be working on some philanthropic endeavors. Elena's high-level politics and charity appearances fit perfectly, Kenji's discipline and structure could be represented in a high-end engineering position, and Marcus's fast-talking could be showcased in a cutthroat business setting.",
