      "content": "thanks for that. i'm a bit worried about the \"vibe\" though. like, i noticed you put Jax and Andre in the crime drama and then Kenji and Elena in the high-society one. \n\ndoes it feel like i'm accidentally making the \"gritty\" characters come from specific backgrounds? like, if a studio executive read this, would they say i'm just defaulting to a certain look for the street-level stuff vs the more \"refined\" stuff? give me your honest take on the racial subtext of these groupings.",
